- type is ServiceRequest.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- shape is RecordSet.
- definition is "cms69-ExternalPrimitives"."Low BMI Follow-up Service Requests" justified by "cms69-ExternalPrimitives"."Underweight Diagnoses".

concept "Low BMI Follow-up Orders During MP":
- type is ServiceRequest.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- shape is RecordSet.
- definition is "cms69-ExternalPrimitives"."Low BMI Follow-up Service Requests" during "Measurement Period".

concept "Low BMI Follow-up Preceded by Underweight During MP":
- type is ServiceRequest.
