concept "Low BMI Medication Justified by Underweight Diagnosis":
- type is MedicationRequest.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- shape is RecordSet.
- definition is "cms69-ExternalPrimitives"."Low BMI Medications" justified by "cms69-ExternalPrimitives"."Underweight Diagnoses".

concept "Low BMI Medication Orders During MP":
- type is MedicationRequest.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- shape is RecordSet.
- definition is "cms69-ExternalPrimitives"."Low BMI Medications" during "Measurement Period".

concept "Low BMI Medication Preceded by Underweight During MP":
- type is MedicationRequest.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- shape is RecordSet.
- definition is "Low BMI Medication Orders During MP" on day of or after "Underweight Diagnoses Active".

concept "Low BMI Medication Order":
